 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "In the Dark Night, the Silver Moon Shines Coldly"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "검은 밤, 은월은 차갑게 빛나고"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "As always, it was a union carried out solely out of \"duty.\"\nThis one, too, was expected to be as dry and emotionless as ever—\nBut due to a scented sachet that a concerned court lady secretly attached to Soyeong's underskirt,\nthe situation begins to unfold in an entirely unexpected direction.\n\nKing Si-hyun, once cold and composed like a blade of frost,\nbegins to move like a parched beast,\nlike a male drawn to the sweet scent of a blooming flower—\ndrawn irresistibly toward its center.\n\n\"I truly did not expect the Queen to go to such lengths.\"\n\"For your effort, Your Majesty, I shall match your rhythm tonight."
  },
